{"byteLength":375,"contentHash":{"algorithm":"sha256","value":"5bbe080f3444a5149f4c31eb79d668b06a47be334c67f8495b3b119c9991a370"},"kind":"skillDocument","name":"references/stdlib/Hash.md","producer":{"build":{"commit":"5de2594ad523fba4f38fa63f7a1b306e8a23eb0c","dirty":false,"provenance":{"commit":"git","dirty":"environment"},"target":"aarch64-apple-darwin"},"name":"benitoite","version":"0.0.13"},"schemaVersion":1,"text":"# Benitoite.Hash\n\nStatus: unofficial. Import it with `import Benitoite.Unofficial.Hash`. When the module becomes standard, the import name changes to `import Benitoite.Hash`.\n\nRefer to its declarations as `Hash.<name>`, for example `Hash.sha256`.\n\nHash values of bytes.\n\n```benitoite\npublic function sha256(b: Bytes) -> Bytes\n```\n\nReturns the SHA-256 hash of `b` (32 bytes).\n"}
